{lang === 'en' && figure === 3 && (
<figure class="pricing-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 863" width="100%" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="l0g-pricing-en-3-title l0g-pricing-en-3-desc">
  <title id="l0g-pricing-en-3-title">The average depends on when litres are bought</title>
  <desc id="l0g-pricing-en-3-desc">Fictional example. The original price is 1.800 euros per litre. After the change, two equally long time slots have prices of 1.70 and 1.84 euros. Their simple average is 1.770 euros. With 20% of litres bought in the first slot and 80% in the second, the average price paid is 1.812 euros.</desc>
  <rect width="480" height="863" rx="16" fill="#0c0e10" />
  <g font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
    <text x="32" y="43" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start">03 / FICTIONAL SCENARIO</text>
